        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"y equals minus 1.9 x minus 10.1\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mn>1.9</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>10.1</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math></p>"
