    "correctAnswer": "A",
    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. A line in the <em>xy</em>-plane that passes through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis x 1 comma y 1 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis x 2 comma y 2 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math> has a slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction y 2 minus y 1 Over x 2 minus x 1 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>. The line of best fit shown passes through the points with approximate coordinates <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 3.2 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3.2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 2 comma 4.4 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4.4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. It follows that the slope of the line of best fit is approximately <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4.4 minus 3.2 Over 2 minus 0 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4.4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3.2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 1.2 Over 2 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>1.2</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"0.6\"><mn>0.6</mn></math>. Therefore, of the given choices, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"0.6\"><mn>0.6</mn></math> is closest to the slope of the line of best fit shown.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>",
