"></use>\n     <use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"239.09487\" xlink:href=\"#me321077b63\" y=\"57.662091\"></use>\n    </g>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_2\">\n    <path clip-path=\"url(#p9817aa21ea)\" d=\"M 59.339103 223.119103 \nL 62.220959 212.809927 \nL 65.102815 203.272822 \nL 67.984671 194.467975 \nL 70.866527 186.356508 \nL 73.748383 178.900475 \nL 76.630239 172.062862 \nL 79.512095 165.80759 \nL 82.393951 160.099509 \nL 85.275807 154.904405 \nL 88.157663 150.188996 \nL 91.039519 145.920932 \nL 93.921375 142.068795 \nL 96.803231 138.602103 \nL 99.685087 135.491303 \nL 102.566943 132.707776 \nL 105.448799 130.223838 \nL 108.330655 128.012734 \nL 111.572743 125.819251 \nL 114.814831 123.903069 \nL 118.056919 122.230329 \nL 121.659239 120.617934 \nL 125.62179 119.094984 \nL 129.944574 117.672798 \nL 134.987822 116.245896 \nL 142.192462 114.465214 \nL 156.601742 110.957786 \nL 162.725686 109.193807 \nL 168.129166 107.395444 \nL 173.172414 105.470035 \nL 177.85543 103.443514 \nL 182.538446 101.171177 \nL 187.221462 98.644041 \nL 191.904478 95.859623 \nL 196.587494 92.821947 \nL 201.630742 89.279593 \nL 207.034222 85.196635 \nL 212.797934 80.555541 \nL 219.642342 74.743586 \nL 230.08907 65.531754 \nL 239.09487 57.662091 \nL 239.09487 57.662091 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n   </g>\n  </g>\n </g>\n <defs>\n  <clipPath id=\"p9817aa21ea\">\n   <rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"262.488358\" x=\"26.679727\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n  </clipPath>\n </defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a curve\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul>\n<li>In quadrant 1:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>The curve begins at point (0 comma 1).</li>\n<li>The curve rises sharply to point (2 comma 6).</li>\n<li>The curve rises gradually to point (4 comma 7).</li>\n<li>The curve rises gradually to point (6 comma 8).</li>\n<li>The curve rises sharply and ends at point (8 comma 10).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure>"
